+# Account export
+
+The finance team imports the accounts each night.
+
+- CLI: `python -m app.cli export --target accounts.csv [--format csv|jsonl]`
+- HTTP: `GET /accounts/export?format=csv`. The answer has at most `EXPORT_MAX_ROWS` rows (default 100,000).
+
+Columns: `id`, `email`, `name`, `created_at`. The name and the creation date are new in 5.3; the finance team needs them for the invoice address check.
